#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/04-arrays-and-records.md:544
msgid "`arr.splice(start, deleteCount, item1, item2, ...)` changes the array **itself**: from index `start` it removes `deleteCount` elements, and puts the new items in their place. It returns the removed elements in a new array."
