#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/04-arrays-and-records.md:729
msgid "`indexOf` and `includes` compare with `===`, so for objects they look for **the same object**, not \"an object with the same keys\": `doc.inventory.enclosures.includes({ id: \"ENC-01\" })` is `false`. To find a record by one of its keys, use a loop (section 10) - or `find` (session 7)."
