#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/04-arrays-and-records.md:736
msgid "`\"4.2.1.7-B00\".includes(\"-\")`, `\"XR-220\".indexOf(\"-\")` (gives 2), `\"4.2.1.7\".at(-1)` and `\"4.2.1.7\".slice(0, 3)` work on strings the same way. More in session 8."
msgstr ""

